{
 "id": "seg5a",
 "title": "守住余数",
 "pill": 5,
 "total": 117.62,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg5a-00",
   "text": "怎么防？有四种做法。",
   "spoken": "怎么防？有四种做法。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg5a-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 2.4,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 3.71
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-01",
   "text": "第一，虚拟份额加偏移。OpenZeppelin 从 4.9 版起提供。",
   "spoken": "第一，虚拟份额加偏移。OpenZeppelin 从 4.9 版起提供。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg5a-01.wav",
   "start": 4.22,
   "dur": 5.68,
   "speechStart": 4.313,
   "speechEnd": 9.657
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-02",
   "text": "计算份额时，总份额加上 10 的偏移次方，总资产加上 1。",
   "spoken": "计算份额时，总份额加上 10 的偏移次方，总资产加上 1。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg5a-02.wav",
   "start": 10.12,
   "dur": 5.6,
   "speechStart": 10.215,
   "speechEnd": 15.519
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-03",
   "text": "攻击者想造成同样的损失，需要捐赠 10 的偏移次方倍的资金。",
   "spoken": "攻击者想造成同样的损失，需要捐赠 10 的偏移次方倍的资金。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg5a-03.wav",
   "start": 15.94,
   "dur": 5.12,
   "speechStart": 15.94,
   "speechEnd": 20.835
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-04",
   "text": "第二，初始存款销毁。部署时先存入一笔，把份额发给死地址。",
   "spoken": "第二，初始存款销毁。部署时先存入一笔，把份额发给死地址。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg5a-04.wav",
   "start": 21.28,
   "dur": 5.84,
   "speechStart": 21.381,
   "speechEnd": 26.935
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-05",
   "text": "这样金库永远不会是空的。",
   "spoken": "这样金库永远不会是空的。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg5a-05.wav",
   "start": 27.34,
   "dur": 2.4,
   "speechStart": 27.437,
   "speechEnd": 29.512
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-06",
   "text": "Uniswap V2 也是这个思路：首次添加流动性时，永久锁定 1000 份 LP 代币。",
   "spoken": "Uniswap V2 也是这个思路：首次添加流动性时，永久锁定 1000 份 LP 代币。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg5a-06.wav",
   "start": 29.96,
   "dur": 7.04,
   "speechStart": 30.06,
   "speechEnd": 36.808
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-07",
   "text": "第三，内部记账。用状态变量记录总资产，不读余额。",
   "spoken": "第三，内部记账。用状态变量记录总资产，不读余额。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg5a-07.wav",
   "start": 37.22,
   "dur": 4.72,
   "speechStart": 37.22,
   "speechEnd": 41.764
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-08",
   "text": "捐赠多少，都无法改变份额价格。",
   "spoken": "捐赠多少，都无法改变份额价格。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg5a-08.wav",
   "start": 42.16,
   "dur": 2.88,
   "speechStart": 42.16,
   "speechEnd": 44.811
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-09",
   "text": "第四，最小份额检查。份额是 0 就回滚，用户也可以设最少到账份额。",
   "spoken": "第四，最小份额检查。份额是 0 就回滚，用户也可以设最少到账份额。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg5a-09.wav",
   "start": 45.26,
   "dur": 6.88,
   "speechStart": 45.36,
   "speechEnd": 51.976
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-10",
   "text": "这样受害者的交易会回滚，而不是换回 0 份额。",
   "spoken": "这样受害者的交易会回滚，而不是换回 0 份额。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg5a-10.wav",
   "start": 52.36,
   "dur": 4.56,
   "speechStart": 52.456,
   "speechEnd": 56.719
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-11",
   "text": "修好了，怎么证明？要两个结果。",
   "spoken": "修好了，怎么证明？要两个结果。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg5a-11.wav",
   "start": 57.14,
   "dur": 2.8,
   "speechStart": 57.14,
   "speechEnd": 59.744
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-12",
   "text": "漏洞版上，受害者损失资产。修复版上，攻击无利可图。",
   "spoken": "漏洞版上，受害者损失资产。修复版上，攻击无利可图。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg5a-12.wav",
   "start": 60.16,
   "dur": 5.44,
   "speechStart": 60.26,
   "speechEnd": 65.403
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-13",
   "text": "最后一个案例，是另一种失误。",
   "spoken": "最后一个案例，是另一种失误。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg5a-13.wav",
   "start": 65.82,
   "dur": 2.32,
   "speechStart": 65.911,
   "speechEnd": 67.93
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-14",
   "text": "2021 年 4 月，BNB Chain 上的 Uranium Finance，分叉自 Uniswap V2。",
   "spoken": "2021 年 4 月，BNB Chain 上的 Uranium Finance，分叉自 Uniswap V2。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg5a-14.wav",
   "start": 68.36,
   "dur": 6.0,
   "speechStart": 68.36,
   "speechEnd": 74.18
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-15",
   "text": "按公开分析，开发者把手续费从百分之 0.3，改成了百分之 0.16。",
   "spoken": "按公开分析，开发者把手续费从百分之 0.3，改成了百分之 0.16。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg5a-15.wav",
   "start": 74.58,
   "dur": 6.72,
   "speechStart": 74.68,
   "speechEnd": 81.074
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-16",
   "text": "余额检查左边的放大系数，从 1000 改成了 1 万。",
   "spoken": "余额检查左边的放大系数，从 1000 改成了 1 万。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg5a-16.wav",
   "start": 81.52,
   "dur": 4.08,
   "speechStart": 81.615,
   "speechEnd": 85.358
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-17",
   "text": "右边那一处，仍是 1000 的平方，漏改了。",
   "spoken": "右边那一处，仍是 1000 的平方，漏改了。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg5a-17.wav",
   "start": 85.82,
   "dur": 4.24,
   "speechStart": 85.82,
   "speechEnd": 89.81
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-18",
   "text": "左边被放大了 100 倍，右边没有。",
   "spoken": "左边被放大了 100 倍，右边没有。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg5a-18.wav",
   "start": 90.28,
   "dur": 2.64,
   "speechStart": 90.28,
   "speechEnd": 92.741
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-19",
   "text": "不变量 x 乘 y 不小于 k，退化成了不小于 k 的百分之一。",
   "spoken": "不变量 x 乘 y 不小于 k，退化成了不小于 k 的百分之一。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg5a-19.wav",
   "start": 93.14,
   "dur": 5.28,
   "speechStart": 93.14,
   "speechEnd": 98.175
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-20",
   "text": "攻击者只投入极少量代币，就换出了池子约百分之 99 的储备。",
   "spoken": "攻击者只投入极少量代币，就换出了池子约百分之 99 的储备。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg5a-20.wav",
   "start": 98.64,
   "dur": 5.28,
   "speechStart": 98.64,
   "speechEnd": 103.687
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-21",
   "text": "按公开报道，损失约 5000 万美元。",
   "spoken": "按公开报道，损失约 5000 万美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg5a-21.wav",
   "start": 104.14,
   "dur": 3.68,
   "speechStart": 104.236,
   "speechEnd": 107.612
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-22",
   "text": "教训是：修改过的分叉代码，等于新代码。",
   "spoken": "教训是：修改过的分叉代码，等于新代码。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg5a-22.wav",
   "start": 108.04,
   "dur": 4.8,
   "speechStart": 108.04,
   "speechEnd": 112.653
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-23",
   "text": "改过的常数，每一个使用位置，都要同步。",
   "spoken": "改过的常数，每一个使用位置，都要同步。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep06/audio/lines/seg5a-23.wav",
   "start": 113.06,
   "dur": 3.36,
